<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Assignment 14 - Nested and Responsive Tables</title>
<style>
/* Responsive: the wrapper scrolls sideways on small screens */
.table-wrap { overflow-x: auto; }
table { border-collapse: collapse; }
th, td { border: 1px solid #333; padding: 12px 14px; text-align: center; }
td table th, td table td { text-align: left; padding: 8px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="table-wrap">
<table>
<tr>
<th>Day</th><th>Lab Batches</th><th>Faculty</th><th>Room</th><th>Time</th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Friday</td>
<td>
<!-- Nested table inside a cell -->
<table>
<tr><th>Batch</th><th>System</th></tr>
<tr><td>A1</td><td>PC 1-20</td></tr>
<tr><td>A2</td><td>PC 21-40</td></tr>
</table>
</td>
<td>Dr. Sharma</td>
<td>Lab 2</td>
<td>2-4 PM</td>
</tr>
</table>
</div>
</body>
</html>
